10
00:52:13,333 --> 00:52:19,333
September 5 is a 2024 German historical drama thriller film
directed, co-written, and produced by Tim Fehlbaum.

11
00:57:26,666 --> 00:57:32,666
The ensemble cast includes Peter Sarsgaard, John
Magaro, Ben Chaplin, and Leonie Benesch.

12
01:02:40,000 --> 01:02:46,000
The film chronicles the Munich massacre of 1972 from the perspective of
the ABC Sports crew and their coverage of the events.

13
01:07:53,333 --> 01:07:59,333
It premiered at the 81st Venice International Film Festival on 29 August 2024,
and was released in Germany by Constantin Film on 9 January 2025.

14
01:13:06,666 --> 01:13:12,666
September 5 received positive reviews from critics and won
several accolades, including nine Lolas.

15
01:18:20,000 --> 01:18:26,000
The film also received nominations for Best Original Screenplay at the 97th Academy
Awards, and Best Motion Picture – Drama at the 82nd Golden Globe Awards.

16
01:23:33,333 --> 01:23:39,333
The film explores themes of palestinian-israeli conflict,
olympic games, 1970s, journalism, munich, germany.

17
01:28:46,666 --> 01:28:52,666
The tone is emotional and intense.
